{'symbol': 'TROW', 'date': '2022-12-23 14:36:00', 'title': 'T. ROWE PRICE APPLAUDS PASSAGE OF SECURE 2.0 ACT RETIREMENT SAVINGS LEGISLATION', 'text': 'BALTIMORE , DEC. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- T. ROWE PRICE, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT FIRM AND A LEADER IN RETIREMENT, ISSUED A STATEMENT ON THE INCLUSION OF SECURE 2.0 ACT RETIREMENT LEGISLATION IN THE CONSOLIDATED APPROPRIATIONS ACT OF 2023 PASSED BY THE U.S. CONGRESS TODAY.'}